%%MIDI ratio 3 2
% %%MIDI ratio n m plays the first note of a>b for n/(n+m) of the total
% length of both notes and the second one for m/(n+m), and a<b the other
% way round.  The file header sets the ratio 3:2 for every tune, and
% tune 2 sets 8:7 in its body.  The sums of both ratios are odd.
X:1
T:Broken rhythm with the ratio 3:2
C:abc2midi test
M:2/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=120
K:C
c>d e<f|g>a b<c'|]

X:2
T:Broken rhythm with the ratio 8:7
C:abc2midi test
M:2/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=120
K:C
%%MIDI ratio 8 7
c>d e<f|g>a b<c'|]
